            "mimeType": "application/javascript",
            "text": "/**\n * @file\n * JavaScript implementation of PageUrlActionButtonPlugin,\n * a source plugin for the nbcore_action_button component.\n */\n\n(function definePlugin($) {\n  var plugin = 'PageUrlActionButtonPlugin';\n\n  /**\n   * Stage data compiled from the current page URL.\n   *\n   * Adds the following to buttonSettings.stageData:\n   *   locationObject - A copy of the JavaScript window.location object.\n   *   urlParams - An associative array of all URL query parameters.\n   */\n  function getUrlParams(buttonSettings) {\n    var urlParams = window.location.search.substr(1).split('&').reduce(function (q, query) {\n      var chunks = query.split('=');\n      var key = chunks[0];\n      var value = chunks[1];\n      q[key] = value;\n      return q;\n    }, {});\n\n    buttonSettings.stageData.PageUrlActionButtonPlugin = {\n      locationObject: window.location,\n      urlParams: urlParams\n    };\n\n    if (buttonSettings.debug) {\n      console.info(plugin + '.getUrlParams', 'stageData:', buttonSettings.stageData);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Define the plugin object with lifecycle functions.\n  Drupal.behaviors.nbcoreActionButton.PageUrlActionButtonPlugin = {\n    process: [getUrlParams]\n  };\n}(jQuery));\n"
